-- TEESTOCK APPAREL & FOUNDER HUB — SINKRONISASI REAL DATABASE INVENTORI
-- Target Supabase: https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/tovslowsopqtuxmrogeu/sql/new
-- Tabel Target: ts_inventory & ts_settings
